[203.686738, "o", "=== Searching for additional formulas ===\r\n"]
[203.687365, "o", "Line 2: Inder Monga,2 Erhan Saglamyurek,1, 2 and Hartmut Haeffner1, 2,†\r\n"]
[203.687438, "o", "Line 14: as ¯nα ≈ 110 for the center-of-mass mode. Our proof-of-principle implementation paves the way\r\n"]
[203.6876, "o", "Line 85: tional excitation, we find coherent excitation of¯nα∼50\r\n"]
[203.687661, "o", "Line 98: ration with the COM mode frequency ofωx,z/(2π) =×\r\n"]
[203.687718, "o", "Line 109: Pc≈2.5%) and directed to a 50/50 beam splitter (BS).\r\n"]
[203.687787, "o", "Line 164: lated for 40min, during which around1.56×106 attempts\r\n"]
[203.687838, "o", "Line 174: where ρ1(τ) and ρ2(τ+δT) are the probability of de-\r\nLine 175: tecting a photon att =τand τ+δTon detector 1 and\r\n"]
[203.687894, "o", "Line 230: where Ω (i) istheRabifrequencyofthe ithion, am anda†\r\n"]
[203.687965, "o", "Line 233: mode, andηi,m istheLDparameterofthe ithionandthe\r\nLine 264: we find a cooling limit of ¯nth = 4.0±3.0. We also\r\n"]
[203.688015, "o", "Line 272: be explained well by a coherent state¯nα=|α|2≈50 on\r\nLine 275: ping matches with COM coherent state with¯nα≈110\r\n"]
[203.68811, "o", "Line 322: †hhaeffner@berkeley.edu\r\n"]
